openChat	2026-09-19	opening a chat must NOT set messages.scrollTop=0 — WebKit fires a sync scroll event that looks like a user scroll-up and clears pinBottom, so the new thread lands mid-history. Only user upward movement (top < lastMsgTop-2) may clear the pin; never !isNearBottom. Short threads need .messages-inner flex:1 0 auto + justify-content:flex-end so the latest message sits at the bottom of the pane.	d7e99ec964a738bb25b367e49d35ce71e8e51cc6	main
